  - a chat/special marker such as <|im_start|>: about zero;
  - a letter word (English or otherwise): clearly positive;
  - a number: mildly positive;
  - pure punctuation or whitespace: about zero;
  - anything else (symbols, emoji, unusual scripts): a middle value.

